Package: easynem
Title: Nematode Community Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Wang", "Kunguang", , "whkygl@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7384-5002"))
Description: Provides a built-in Nemaplex database for nematodes, 
    which can be used to search for various nematodes. 
    Also supports various nematode community and functional 
    analyses such as nematode diversity, maturity index, metabolic footprint, 
    and functional guild.
